---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Request a project" description="Learn what RepoReady needs to review a project. Request intake is not yet available; a local GitHub URL check does not submit a request." canonicalPath="/request/">
  <section class="section prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Help shape the catalog</p>
    <h1 class="page-heading">Request a project</h1>
    <div class="notice"><strong>Request intake is not available yet.</strong><p>This website does not send, store, or queue requests. There is no submission service or request tracking ID. Check back when intake opens.</p></div>
    <h2>What a review needs</h2>
    <ul><li>A public project source and identifiable author.</li><li>A license that permits the intended distribution.</li><li>Clear installation instructions, platform support, resource needs, and costs.</li><li>Privacy and network disclosures, maintained releases, and known limitations.</li></ul>
    <p>Reviewing a candidate does not guarantee packaging, certification, or publication. Standalone distribution and the managed-runtime requirement are assessed separately.</p>
    <form id="request-check" hidden>
      <h2>Check a repository link locally</h2>
      <label class="field-label" for="repository-url">Public GitHub repository URL</label>
      <input class="field" id="repository-url" type="url" required maxlength="300" placeholder="https://github.com/owner/project" aria-describedby="repository-help repository-result" />
      <p id="repository-help">Use an HTTPS GitHub link to the repository root. This check stays in your browser and does not submit a request.</p>
      <button class="button" type="submit">Check link only</button>
      <p id="repository-result" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    </form>
    <noscript><p>A repository link should look like https://github.com/owner/project. Local format checking requires JavaScript.</p></noscript>
    <p><a href="/catalog/">Browse existing candidates</a> · <a href="/support/">Support and current availability</a></p>
  </section>
  <script>import '../scripts/request-check';</script>
</SiteLayout>
